+/// Whether the sidebar with the eye on lists a block: what it runs is a coding agent, or it
+/// reports a status (`status_app`, null without a status) as one. A program such as Leaf
+/// reports a status too, for the command palette, but it is not an agent.
+pub fn listsAsAgent(process: ?[]const u8, status_app: ?[]const u8) bool {
+    return isAgent(process) or isAgent(status_app);
+}
